flowchart TD
    comparison{"Comparison snapshot available?"} --> unevaluated["No snapshot: change obligation unevaluated; supplied values still checked"]
    comparison --> changed{"Snapshot available: existing entity content changed?"}
    changed --> required["Changed existing entity: valid modification value required"]
    changed --> optional["New or unchanged entity: no comparison-based requirement for a value"]
    required --> retained["An unchanged valid timestamp is accepted"]
    optional --> constrained["Any supplied value remains constrained"]
    new["Newly added entity"] --> optional
